# Shell scripts and container entrypoints must stay LF: they execute inside
# Linux containers, where a CRLF shebang ("bash\r") is a hard failure.
# (core.autocrlf=true on Windows checkouts rewrote scripts/agy/*.sh to CRLF
# and broke the Phase 0 image build — this pins them at the repo level.)
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
